# GUI rules

- CustomTkinter, dark mode default, minimal but powerful.
- URL paste + bulk import button; queue with live progress.
- Clear visual indication that only one download runs at a time.
- Cancel, retry, priority controls wired to SQLite repository.
- Settings: format preset and upscale-after-download.
- Keyboard-friendly; avoid dashboard clutter and card-heavy chrome.
